WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.950
Disgaea

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:16.250
It's like I'm tied up tight
by the sighs of love.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:21.320
I can't break free
no matter what spell I try.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:29.040
Tranquil eyes that conceal
sorrow behind them...

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:34.270
...throw my heart into turmoil
more than they ought to.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:42.810
You mean more to me
than I do,

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:49.050
...even though we both refuse
to admit to our feelings.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:55.220
You're the one for me.
I don't care if you're a demon.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:01.930
Oh, this is a miracle that
I've stumbled upon.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:08.440
Even these wounds that never fade,
even this profound karma.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.770
Oh, I'll give you
my love.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.280
Time and again,
no matter where you are.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.920
I'll give you my love.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.470
And that's when
I lost it!

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.630
So I hauled off and planted my boot
right in his you-know-whats!

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.010
You-know-whats?

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:44.770
By that, I mean his...

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.140
You know, those!

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:52.410
Oh, I see!
Um, what are those?

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.620
Okay, I'll just show you!

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.770
Sheesh, Highness!
What was that for?!

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:10.890
Be quiet!

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.100
I listen in on what you're mumbling about,
and what do I hear? Stupid nonsense!

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.240
Oh, you were listening to that
part I was whispering?

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:19.580
Every last word!

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.380
The Prince has some
stupefyingly sharp ears.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.040
Who are you
calling stupid?!

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.810
Wow, he really can hear you!
That's amazing!

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:32.960
Anyway, I don't want you talking about
idiotic crap behind my back from now on!

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.490
Is that clear?!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.930
I love yuie flowers.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:44.230
They're simple, but bright and cheery,
and they always make me feel happy.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:49.080
I bet that the yuie are blooming
all over Celestia right about now.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.450
Uh, hello?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:03.320
Yikes, I guess this is a literal case of
somebody having a head full of flowers.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.150
What?! What's the matter?

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:12.660
When I pictured all those yuie flowers,
the Seraph's face popped into my head!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:19.300
Ah-ha! I bet he did something nasty
to you! Right, Flonne?

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:20.730
Something nasty?

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:24.310
Like bullying you, for instance!
Or punishing you!

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:25.770
Or torturing you!

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.350
Y-You're joking!

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:32.090
Seraph Lamington is a kindhearted man
who loves flowers and poetry!

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:36.010
The Seraph is a person who
has my undying respect.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:37.950
I admire him
so much!

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:42.030
Etna, do you have anyone
that you respect like that?

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.070
King Krichevskoy,
I suppose.

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:50.170
Well, it's less like "respect" and more
like he's the standard I aim for.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:56.110
Hey, Etna! So does that mean
that you don't respect me?!

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:57.570
Yes.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.710
And you call yourself
my vassal?!

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:03.980
Well, more or less.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.720
Enough of this! I'm tired!
I intend to rest!

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:12.720
Rest? Where, you mean here?

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:16.020
Moron! The next Overlord can't
possibly sleep outdoors!

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.530
Take me to an inn!

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:24.370
Uh, Highness, there are no inns
anywhere around here.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.670
There has to be something.
Find one.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.070
I can look, but that won't
change anything.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.230
Prinny Squad!

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:33.780
<i>Hey, wait just a minute, Highness!
Why are you calling them?</i>

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.040
Your vassals
are my vassals.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:39.520
In other words, my vassals' vassals
are my vassals, too.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.610
Get out here,
Prinny Squad!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.330
You bellowed, dood?

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:51.370
Take me to the nearest inn!

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:55.090
<i>There aren't
any inns.</i>

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.240
<i>But there is something
that's sorta inn-ish.</i>

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.460
This way, dood!

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.910
Party of three!

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:10.970
Welcome to the Netherworld
Hall of Treasures

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.550
What's this place?

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.750
This place is even recorded in Netherworld
Tales of Times Now Past,

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.420
and has instilled fear in all
since time immemorial, dood!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.600
It's said that the late
Overlord Krichevskoy used to...

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.190
...secretly come here to
this legendary place, dood!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.240
This mysterious castle that was
built right into the side...

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:35.430
...of Atamee Hell Valley is protected
more heavily today than it ever was!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.410
This smells fishy.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:40.280
You think so?
I'm so excited!

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.410
I don't like the fact that my
old man used to come here,

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.920
...but I've decided to stay here tonight,
so you'd best be grateful.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.190
Welcome, honored doods!

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:54.130
Atamee Valley...
It's a Hell Valley...

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.890
Welcome to the Netherworld
Hall of Treasures!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.430
Oh, wow!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:02.930
What a lovely, sweet sound that has!
"Hall of Treasures"!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:26.260
The Hall of Treasures is recorded in the
Netherworld Tales of Times Now Past, and...

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.730
Spare me the tour book lecture.
I already heard that story.

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:32.690
What's this?

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.200
Well, sir, that's...

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:37.960
Dood, no!

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:40.410
This will do!
I'll sleep on this.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.840
Sir, you can't! That bed
is a display item!

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:47.210
Highness, you shouldn't
touch the display items!

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:48.840
You're just supposed
to look, dood!

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:52.580
Silence! I said that I'm
gonna sleep on this!

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:57.390
In that case, have a pleasant
rest, everyone.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.460
What do you suppose
this is?

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.360
This panel has lots
of buttons!

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.470
Let's try hitting a few!
Click!

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.560
Neat!

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.070
Hey, cut that out!

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:14.230
Next, I'll try this button!
Click!

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:27.580
Damn it, stop...
Ugh, I don't feel so good...

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.290
Extra! Extra!

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.660
Read all about it!

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.160
Extra!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:47.140
What's the big idea?! Do you want His
Highness to find out what I'm up to?!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.310
Hey.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.940
What were those
leaflets about?

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:55.070
Oh, it's no big deal.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.380
Show me one.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:59.750
Oh, they're just a plain old
extra newspaper edition.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.080
Just shut up
and show me one!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:11.100
Why, it's a leaflet proclaiming
the comeback of Overlord Laharl!

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:14.270
How can you say that
this is no big deal?

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:19.800
Oh, don't be silly, Highness!
What I said was, "This is SO a big deal!"

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.010
That's what you said?

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:21.730
Yes, sir!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:25.840
If you say so.
I'm tired, so I'm going to bed.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.810
I'm also sleepy,
so I'm gonna turn in!

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.320
Good night!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.250
Wow, they
fall asleep fast!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:42.760
The one who ordered the Prinnies to plaster
flyers all over the Netherworld...

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:46.530
...proclaiming the Prince's return
was none other than me!

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:51.830
All the demons who are vying for the throne
will see them, learn that the Prince is back,

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.370
...and try to kill him.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:09:00.170
<i>The Prince will tragically be killed,
and in the ensuing confusion,</i>

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:04.480
<i>...the person who will plant her fanny
on the throne will be me!</i>

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.510
Flonne, I see that you have thoroughly
ingratiated yourself with these demons.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:38.690
I must say, this is exactly how I imagined
a demon's den would look...

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.950
This place positively
reeks of wickedness.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.590
T-This is a deed that defies
the laws of God and man!

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:51.700
O Lord, forgive me!
Grant salvation unto this girl!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.380
I slept like a log...

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:10.650
W-What the...?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.090
Good morning...

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.450
Yo, Highness!

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:22.360
Did you sleep well,
Laharl?

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:25.330
Are you all right?

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:28.300
What's your problem?
I swear, you're such a spaz.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.540
Disgaea

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:44.550
Disgaea

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:54.560
Boy, I'm starving.
I wanna chow-down-on-some-thing!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:56.120
Stop this!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:58.560
Oh, you're doing the
morning cleaning?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:05.270
You're such hard workers, everyone.
Let me help you!

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:09.400
Hey, you! Quit yer dawdling
and get to cleaning!

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:12.070
Flonne, there was
no call for that!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.780
Flonne, violence is
never the answer!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.140
Are you all right?

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:21.150
That's mean!

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:22.220
You're acting like
a demon!

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:25.650
None of you
are hurt?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:32.160
Doods, I'm so happy! I've never been
treated so kindly by Lady Etna before!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.800
It's only natural to lend a helping
hand to those in need, right?

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:40.730
After all, it's love that makes
the world go round!

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:44.970
And on the other hand,
we have this one...

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:45.810
She's a brute!

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:46.940
A brutal brute!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.140
She's terrible!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.280
Quit your griping and
get back to work!

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.390
Flonne, what did you
go and do that for?!

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:00.920
Now I get it.

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:06.900
It looks like the Love Freak angel and the
smartass demon have swapped personalities.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:10.660
But when did it happen?
And how?

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:13.270
That's because this is
the Treasure Hall.

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:14.300
What?

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:17.380
I just said, it's because this is
the Netherworld Treasure Hall.

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:18.370
Huh?

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:21.140
Everything that has happened did so because
this is the Netherworld Treasure Hall!

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:26.710
Laharl! Flonne!
Please fall in!

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:29.720
I'm now going to show you
around the Treasure Hall!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:33.860
In this room, various
rare items, antiques,

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:36.760
...and treasures of every kind of
the Netherworld are on display!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.800
Treasures of every kind?!
Treasures?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.060
From the left, we have a
white-hot, blinding horn!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.010
The cold sweat
of a dragon!

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.240
The evil nose ring
of a demon bull!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.240
The tail of an
obstinate lizard!

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.540
And last, but not least!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.810
Here we have a bronze
bust of a demon...

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.910
...that is said to dispense your
bad fortune if you put in a coin!

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.780
Now, put in a coin
and make your fortune!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.390
Your fortune!
Get it?!

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:05.550
Come on, let's get going!
This is stupid!

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:08.960
No, seriously!
Insert a coin!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.070
Highness,
wait for me!

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:17.230
I'm so sorry! I couldn't get anyone to insert
a coin, so you don't have any lines.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:22.840
And now, to change things up a little,
this is the Game Corner!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:27.910
What's the deal? Every last
one of 'em is broken!

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:31.920
(Live!) Whack-A-Prinny
This game is working
just fine!

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:32.420
(Live!) Whack-A-Prinny

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:33.050
(Live!) Whack-A-Prinny
One by one, the cute little Prinnies will
stick their heads out of these holes!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:36.180
One by one, the cute little Prinnies will
stick their heads out of these holes!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.620
With that in mind,
please hit them gently.

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:44.860
Eat this!

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:46.600
Yahoo!

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:50.870
No, Flonne, don't!
Hit them gently!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:01.040
Please, I think you should stop!
Look at the poor Prinnies!

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:04.750
Okay, Highness, it's time
for you to tap in...

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.090
What's the big idea?!

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.850
Highness, c'mon!

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:16.030
Insolent wench!

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.460
Take this!

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:27.000
O Lord, Laharl is putting himself at risk
for the sake of these Prinnies...

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:28.800
I'm so touched!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:33.640
In this next game, you move the figures
by pushing and pulling these handles.

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:34.850
See?

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.280
Yay! That looks like fun!

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:42.450
- Final showdown, take two!
- Final showdown, take two!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.090
Take him down!

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:48.420
That's my line!

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:07.640
I'm exhausted...

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:12.410
Aw, but I had hoped to show you the
Famous Suicide Spot Corner...

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:14.820
...and the Secret
Hot Springs Corner!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:15.850
Not interested!

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.690
Hey, guide chick!
What's this supposed to be?

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:24.190
Um, let me see... It's called
a "double-tongued clam".

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:26.920
It's a peculiar clam whose
two tongues lick nonstop...

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.700
...any foreign object that
gets trapped inside.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:31.000
Huh.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.510
Hey. Since we're on the subject of questions,
what's the story with that door there?

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:44.580
Oh, that. That's a door that, once you enter,
you can never come out again.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:48.750
Take a look at it, you moron!
It's a freestanding door!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:51.490
Let me see...
Ah, here it is!

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:56.620
In the guide book, it says that no one
who has entered it has been seen again,

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:58.930
...so they aren't sure
how it works.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:03.490
I've heard enough! I swear, this
"Hall of Treasures" is a useless dump!

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:09.140
Come on, now!
Let's work hard for free!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:11.070
Love is what service
is all about!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:16.450
In one sense, our forced labor
just got a lot harder...

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:19.750
Lady Etna is using
different words, that's all.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:22.410
When it's all said and done,
she's ignoring labor guidelines, dood.

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:26.760
Goofing off is a sin! Come on,
let's work for love!

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:33.360
Damn it, cut that out!

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:37.830
Fine, suit yourself! I'm gonna go
whack some more Prinnies, then!

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.740
Forget you!

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:45.740
This is ridiculous... I wonder
what happened to those two?

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.250
You seem to be
in a real bind!

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.510
Oh, it's you losers.

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.780
Is that any way
to greet us?

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.950
What's with the getups?

00:16:56.060 --> 00:17:00.290
We're working part-time as emergency
medical technicians at the moment.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:03.250
Stay away from me,
you voluptuous hussy!

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:07.490
I'm not the one who needs a doctor!
It's those two over there!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:09.890
How do you do, everyone?

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:11.230
Yo!

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:24.480
It would seem that their personalities
have been switched.

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:28.180
I already figured that out!
How do we turn them back to normal?!

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:30.120
As for that,
I do not know.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:34.290
If you don't have anything
to offer, get lost!

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.860
So long, suckers!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:40.630
Oh, but they
just got here!

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:45.230
Okay, all you Prinnies!
It's time to get back to work!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.430
You're gonna make us
work some more?!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:52.340
You're serving a cause!
Let's all share the joy of work!

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:54.410
<i>Or would you rather
serve me?</i>

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.850
We'll take the
hard labor, dood!

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:59.040
- Hey, wait!
- Come back here!

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:03.850
They don't leave me much choice. I'll leave
them here until they turn back to normal.

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:06.060
How very unattractive
of you!

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:07.390
You say something,
statue?

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.620
I'll have you know that my name
is the Dark Adonis, Vy...

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.530
Put a sock in it,
Mid-Boss!

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:14.190
Have it your way, then.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.890
More importantly, do you seriously intend
to set out for the overlord's castle alone,

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.570
...leaving those two here
in their switched state?

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:21.840
What's the problem
with that?

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:25.610
It's not like not having those two around
is gonna cause me any trouble.

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.300
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:34.210
No man is an island unto himself.
We can't live without love.

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:35.950
Love is worthless.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:40.460
There is just one way, just one,
to return those two to normal.

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:41.790
What?

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:46.960
You must get them to enter this door.
Or so it is said.

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:51.700
But the book said that anyone who goes
into this door never comes out again.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:55.710
Heave ho, heave ho,
Atamee, dood! Hell Valley, dood!

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:58.940
Getting rid of you will free us
from you cruel slave drivers!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.810
In ya go!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:05.720
What are you doing?!

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:14.550
Why did they toss me
in here, too?

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:18.360
These are souls.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:21.560
Souls that have been preyed upon
by their weaknesses...

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:24.190
...and taken prisoner here,
and now they can't get out.

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:27.440
By weakness...

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:04.640
You mustn't be caught up in
the torrents of weakness.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:10.310
Once you are engulfed by it,
you will never break free, Laharl.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:16.990
On the other hand, those two are switched,
so they might be able to resist!

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:22.220
Maybe! Just maybe! The two girls alone
will be able to step through this door!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:23.230
Possibly.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:24.850
Dial down
the exposition, dood.

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:27.790
This is so pretty!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.760
I hadn't looked at it
that way.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:35.000
What's lost is lost, right?
I just need to go get it back!

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.300
C'mon, Laharl,
cheer up!

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:40.810
As long as you're still alive,
things can always get better! Right?

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:42.580
You cheer up, too!

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:48.250
Haul off and blow this place away
with your Overlord's Wrath, Laharl!

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:50.380
She's right!
Haul off, dood!

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.050
Go go, Highness!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:57.260
Their ditzy cheerfulness drives me up the wall,
but it looks like that's what set them free.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:07.730
Hey, no fair!
No sexy women!

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:11.680
This is the Netherworld.
Demons are expected to fight dirty.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:17.310
Go go, Highness!
Go go go!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.210
Go go, Laharl!
Go go go!

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.150
They're back to normal!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:27.430
Atamee Valley,
Hell Valley!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:32.400
How much farther are you two gonna
push this "happy-go-lucky" crap?!

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.910
We eagerly await
your next visit, doods!

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:46.140
There's no point in staying here
any longer. Let's go!

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:47.180
Coming!

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:51.410
Thank you, doods!
Come back soon!

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:00.990
I've had it up to here with this...
Lovely Hall of Treasures!

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:02.720
That's for sure, Highness.

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:04.890
Still, "Hall of Treasures" does
have a lovely and sweet...

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:07.660
...ring to it no matter
how many times I hear it.

00:22:08.170 --> 00:22:11.900
What about that place
is lovely and sweet?

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:49.130
If people ever notice the cycle of time
on this world where blue skies come and go,

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:57.210
something's bound to happen when people
with different outlooks get together.

00:22:57.520 --> 00:23:05.360
Will we be buried by our desires?
Will love come and save the day?

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:12.420
Either way, it doesn't matter to me.
I'm gonna do as I please.

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:20.870
Light and shadow, egoists for whom
everything in the world has meaning,

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:28.640
every little fragment lives his life
with the balance on their shoulders.

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:36.090
Doing whatever we want,
having it exactly the way we want it.

00:23:36.790 --> 00:23:40.520
Right now,
under the same sky,

00:23:40.630 --> 00:23:44.620
light and shadow
repeat again and again.

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:49.830
Chain react...

00:23:56.440 --> 00:24:01.040
All right, Celestian! Your many misdeeds
have been laid bare!

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:02.640
I will therefore pass sentence
on the accused!

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:04.410
Do you have any proof?
Where's your evidence?!

00:24:04.520 --> 00:24:06.950
"Where's your proof, where's your proof?"
I'm sick of your whining about proof, punk!

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:11.090
I've got your proof right here! Take a good look
at this Etna blossom blizzard on my back!

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:14.320
Oh, wow! Did you draw that cherry
blossom blizzard tattoo yourself?!

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:18.260
Next time on Disgaea! "A Solomon-style
Judgment in the Dinero Castle?!"

00:24:18.370 --> 00:24:20.600
Huh? But wasn't your schtick just now
from that old "Kin-san" period drama?

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:21.370
Next Time:
A Solomon-style Judgment
in the Dinero Castle?!

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:22.370
Next Time:
A Solomon-style Judgment
in the Dinero Castle?!
Um... Yeah.

00:24:22.370 --> 00:24:25.500
Next Time:
A Solomon-style Judgment
in the Dinero Castle?!
